    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-18T21:17:19+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-18T21:17:19+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-18T10:47:19Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-18T10:47:19Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure system and associated trough over Western Australia move over western South Australia this evening and broadly across the state during Thursday, clearing to the east early Friday. A high pressure system will then move across southern SA from Friday, before a trough and cold front move across the west late Saturday and across the rest of SA on Sunday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW005" description="Lower South East" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-18T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-19T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-18T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-18T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Winds southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-19T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-18T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the afternoon and evening. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 8:50am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 10 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h shifting westerly 25 to 35 km/h in the morning then tending northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 16 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning. Mostly sunny afternoon. Winds west to northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 14 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h turning west to northwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
